{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43604","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 崇义坊招福院 赠诸上人联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 崇义坊招福院 赠诸上人联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飜了西天偈，烧余梵宇香。\n捻眉愁俗客，支颊背残阳。\n洲号惟思沃，山名祗记匡。\n辨中摧世智，定里破魔强。\n许叡禅心彻，汤休诗思长。\n朗吟疎磬断，久语贯珠妨。\n乘兴书芭叶，闲来入豆房。\n漫题存古壁，怪画匝长廊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}